Package: micad
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: mica build <mica@example.invalid>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: default-dbus-system-bus | dbus-system-bus, mica-system, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Mica OS management daemon
 Owns the device settings, converges system services to them and serves the
 root-only com.mica.micad D-Bus interface. Starts at boot.
